# Netcup SCP — Server Metrics
#
# Requires: access_token, server_id
# Returns time-series performance data for the specified server.
# Response typically includes timestamps and measured values for the given metric type.

### 1 — CPU Metrics
# Returns CPU utilization over time (percentage).
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/cpu
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 2 — Disk Metrics
# Returns disk I/O metrics (read/write throughput or IOPS).
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/disk
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 3 — Network Traffic Metrics
# Returns network throughput in bytes per second (ingress/egress).
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/network-traffic
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 4 — Network Packet Metrics
# Returns packet counts per second (ingress/egress).
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/metrics/network-packets
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
